  "about": [
    "Shared parameters of the ELS retrofit, Roher TBL-20/520 (= Axminster BV20M, 200 x 520 bench lathe).",
    "Single source of truth for every SolidCraft part design (cad/designs/*.sc). Edit a value here, then run `python3 cad/build.py`:",
    "each part gets the parameters it uses (with these expressions, so they stay live in SolidCraft) and the assembly is rebuilt.",
    "Entries: [name, expression, unit, comment]. Unit '' = unitless, 'deg' = angle, default mm. MEASURE = lathe-dependent, see cad/README.md.",
    "Frame (every part): front view of the gear end panel. Origin = leadscrew shaft axis L on the banjo-seat plane (casting face = blue panel face),",
